# Platform — demo requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
# Run the host first:  dotnet run --project src/Hosts/Host.CairoUniversity
# Local DB connection (once):  dotnet user-secrets set ConnectionStrings:Portal "Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=nimi_portal;Username=postgres;Password=<password>" --project src/Hosts/Host.CairoUniversity

@host = http://localhost:5080

### Process alive → 200 Healthy
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Database reachable → 200 Healthy (503 Unhealthy if PostgreSQL is down or not configured)
GET {{host}}/api/health/db
